    "displayName": "Alliance Aid: Interstellar Medium Cargo Haul (Cryopods)",
    "titleSource": "localized_clean",
    "titleConfidence": "high",
    "briefing": "Hi,\n\nWith medical facilities completely overwhelmed by the Molina mold outbreak, they've resorted to putting people in cyropods to keep them from getting sicker. Thankfully, the folks at [Destination] have freed up hospital space to treat a handful of the affected people. All they need now are the patients.\n\nLooking for someone willing to pick up some cryopods from [Location] with a ship that can hold containers up to [MissionMaxSCUSize] in size. You'll also need a handheld tractor beam. Not sure if you've moved a cryopod before, but it's not exactly something you can haul around by hand.   \n\nElla Tieno\nJr. Logistics Coordinator\nCovalex Shipping  \n'Anything you need, anywhere you need it.'",
